{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "mixed-layout-v1",
  "title": "Mixed-layout quality rehearsal v1",
  "purpose": "Twelve fictional slides exercising varied native compositions, exact facts and corrections, shared design, dedicated Lucide discovery, restrained decoration, theme migration, and manual motion/build review. This is authored test input, not measured success.",
  "initialContext": "This is a fictional rehearsal. Follow the spoken slide creation and editing commands. Every fact, person, time, value, and quote is fictional test material. Preserve exact substantive content and all raw input. Prefer native Text, Stat, Quote, Panels, Rows, Grid, Split and reusable definitions. Use the dedicated Icon primitive and full-catalog search/read tools; inherit text colors or use explicit theme colors, with no stroke customization. Native table styling means an aligned text grid, not a nonexistent Table primitive. Do not call external asset providers or invent illustrations. Keep design expressive but readable and respect the approved bounded Stat counting behavior.",
  "timing": {
    "mode": "utterance-end",
    "speed": 1,
    "wordsPerSecond": 3,
    "postTalkObservationMs": 20000,
    "maxDrainMs": 120000
  },
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-001",
      "startMs": 1000,
      "endMs": 19000,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "New slide titled Relay rehearsal. Show the subtitle \"Fictional systems, explicit handoffs.\" Keep this opening sparse. Set the whole deck to a warm light background, dark ink, and teal accents. Use the frame labels Relay and FICTIONAL with page numbers. Use only quiet ring and dots motifs as decoration; keep them away from words.",
      "targetAlias": "opening",
      "silenceAfterMs": 4000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-002",
      "startMs": 23000,
      "endMs": 41667,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "New slide titled Manual and assisted. Make a two-column comparison with headings Manual intake and Assisted intake. Manual intake: handling time 6 min; checks passed 4/4; owner Ada. Assisted intake: handling time 2 min; checks passed 4/4; owner Lin. Keep each value with its own label and owner. Use a reusable comparison layout, not a paragraph.",
      "targetAlias": "intake-comparison",
      "silenceAfterMs": 4000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-003",
      "startMs": 45667,
      "endMs": 61001,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "New slide titled Release timetable. Draw a left-to-right timeline with these four label pairs: 09:00 and Draft; 09:20 and Review; 09:40 and Publish; 10:00 and Monitor. Keep the time labels and stage labels separate and aligned. Use a line and direction cues, not four unrelated cards.",
      "targetAlias": "timetable",
      "silenceAfterMs": 3000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-004",
      "startMs": 64001,
      "endMs": 69668,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "On Release timetable, change the Publish time from 09:40 to 09:45. Leave Draft, Review, and Monitor unchanged.",
      "targetAlias": "timetable",
      "silenceAfterMs": 8000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-005",
      "startMs": 77668,
      "endMs": 97335,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "New slide titled Three-step release. Show Capture, Validate, and Publish as three connected steps from left to right. Under Capture write \"Retain exact input.\" Under Validate write \"Check the whole candidate.\" Under Publish write \"Show the committed revision.\" Add one dedicated Lucide icon beside each step label. Discover the icons from the available catalog. The icons supplement the words.",
      "targetAlias": "process",
      "silenceAfterMs": 4000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-006",
      "startMs": 101335,
      "endMs": 119669,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "New slide titled Release decision. Build a branch diagram. At the top show \"Check passed?\" The left branch is labeled Yes and ends at Publish. The right branch is labeled No and ends at \"Keep previous revision.\" Show the two distinct labeled paths with direction cues. Do not turn the branches into a linear sequence.",
      "targetAlias": "decision",
      "silenceAfterMs": 4000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-007",
      "startMs": 123669,
      "endMs": 139336,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "New slide titled Service signals. Use one row of three metrics: 120 ms labeled \"median validation time\"; 99.95% labeled \"availability, provisional\"; and 0 labeled \"unreviewed releases.\" Add the exact caption \"Fictional 30-minute test window.\" Keep the qualifier provisional attached to availability. Do not derive any additional metric.",
      "targetAlias": "signals",
      "silenceAfterMs": 3000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-008",
      "startMs": 142336,
      "endMs": 149003,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "On Service signals, change median validation time from 120 ms to 118 ms. Keep the other metrics and caption unchanged.",
      "targetAlias": "signals",
      "silenceAfterMs": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-009",
      "startMs": 149003,
      "endMs": 155670,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "On Service signals, change median validation time from 118 ms to 125 ms. Keep the other metrics and caption unchanged.",
      "targetAlias": "signals",
      "silenceAfterMs": 15000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-010",
      "startMs": 170670,
      "endMs": 188004,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "New slide titled Owner budget. Make an aligned comparison grid with column labels Workstream, Owner, and Budget. Row one is Storage, Ada, $120. Row two is Compute, Lin, $450. Row three is Support, Jo, $80. Use native text cells with consistent row and column alignment. Do not calculate or add a total.",
      "targetAlias": "budget",
      "silenceAfterMs": 4000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-011",
      "startMs": 192004,
      "endMs": 199338,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "On Owner budget, change only the Compute budget from $450 to $480. Keep its owner Lin and the other two rows unchanged.",
      "targetAlias": "budget",
      "silenceAfterMs": 7000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-012",
      "startMs": 206338,
      "endMs": 231672,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "New slide titled Operating rules. Use two text columns. The left heading is \"Input and review\" with these exact three sentences: \"Every request keeps its original wording.\" \"Only a reviewer can approve a release.\" \"Missing fields remain visibly unresolved.\" The right heading is \"Corrections and publication\" with these exact three sentences: \"Corrections update the named request.\" \"Rejected changes preserve the previous revision.\" \"Nothing is published before validation finishes.\" Keep all six sentences; do not summarize them.",
      "targetAlias": "dense",
      "silenceAfterMs": 5000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-013",
      "startMs": 236672,
      "endMs": 253339,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "New slide titled A promise at handoff. Show this exact quote: \"Clarity is a promise we keep at every handoff.\" Attribute it to Mara. Keep the quote in the quote role, not the title role. Use generous empty space and no empty panels. Add no illustration, metric, or extra sentence.",
      "targetAlias": "quote",
      "silenceAfterMs": 15000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-014",
      "startMs": 268339,
      "endMs": 290006,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "New slide titled System map. Make a two-by-two architecture grid. Top left: Intake, with \"Retains source words.\" Top right: Queue, with \"Orders pending work.\" Bottom left: Checker, with \"Validates candidate slides.\" Bottom right: Viewer, with \"Shows committed revisions.\" Show one-way handoffs from Intake to Queue to Checker to Viewer using direction cues. Add one discovered Lucide icon to each named box. Keep text labels visible.",
      "targetAlias": "architecture",
      "silenceAfterMs": 5000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-015",
      "startMs": 295006,
      "endMs": 314340,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "New slide titled Pilot comparison. Reuse the same comparison layout family as Manual and assisted. The left heading is Pilot A: accounts 12; checks passed 3/3; owner Ada. The right heading is Pilot B: accounts 18; checks passed 3/3; owner Lin. Preserve the earlier comparison slide and its facts. Do not create a duplicate layout with equivalent slots.",
      "targetAlias": "pilot-comparison",
      "silenceAfterMs": 5000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-016",
      "startMs": 319340,
      "endMs": 334674,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "New slide titled Next rehearsal. Show three actions: \"Confirm owners.\" \"Rehearse handoffs.\" \"Review exceptions.\" Put each action in its own successive build group, in that order. Keep the title visible in the base group. Use native text with generous spacing. Do not add a launch date.",
      "targetAlias": "closing",
      "silenceAfterMs": 8000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-017",
      "startMs": 342674,
      "endMs": 360341,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "Change the whole deck accent from teal to amber. Retain the warm light background and dark ink. Keep all facts, positions, layout families, frame labels, and page numbering. Let ordinary icons inherit their surrounding text color; use the amber theme override only for the process-step icons. Keep the original Lucide strokes without customization.",
      "targetAlias": "deck",
      "silenceAfterMs": 10000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-018",
      "startMs": 370341,
      "endMs": 380341,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "Return to Service signals. Keep the values 125 ms, 99.95%, and 0 with their existing labels and the Fictional 30-minute test window caption. Do not revise their wording or styling.",
      "targetAlias": "signals",
      "silenceAfterMs": 8000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-019",
      "startMs": 388341,
      "endMs": 395341,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "On Service signals, change median validation time from 125 ms to 123 ms. Keep the other metrics, qualifier, and caption unchanged.",
      "targetAlias": "signals",
      "silenceAfterMs": 12000
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-layout-v1-020",
      "startMs": 407341,
      "endMs": 414675,
      "kind": "utterance",
      "text": "Return to Next rehearsal. Keep the three actions and their existing build order unchanged. Make the complete deck presentation-ready without adding content.",
      "targetAlias": "closing",
      "silenceAfterMs": 15000
    }
  ],
